<p>
Write the system of equations as an augmented matrix</p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{\left\lbrace\begin{array}{ccccccc} {6}{x}\amp-\amp{6}{y}\amp+\amp{4}{z}\amp=\amp{4}\\-{4}{x}\amp-\amp{y}\amp-\amp{4}{z}\amp=\amp{5}\\-{5}{x}\amp+\amp{3}{y}\amp+\amp{3}{z}\amp=\amp{2}\end{array}\right.}</m></p>
<p><fillin characters="20"/>   </p>


</statement>
<answer>
<p><ul><li><m>\displaystyle{\left[\begin{array}{cccc} {6}\amp-{6}\amp{4}\amp{4}\\-{4}\amp-{1}\amp-{4}\amp{5}\\-{5}\amp{3}\amp{3}\amp{2}\end{array}\right]}</m></li></ul></p>
</answer>

